      },
      "context": "concept — mobile web player navigation — Navigation is one floating island that carries playback: artwork with a progress ring, three tabs (Home, Search, Library — Jam lives in Library as a filter with live Jams on top) and play. It shrinks to artwork + track while scrolling down, widens for live activity (Jam, Bitrate Connect, releases), shows quick actions on hold and blooms into the player on tap or swipe up. Swipe anywhere on it sideways to skip: the neighbour’s cover slides into the ring with its title above the island, past 46px it commits, short of it springs back; the compact island adds a next button; the first visit nudges the cover once. Home resumes, tunes by feeling and shows bento tiles instead of shelves. · no desktop frame: mobile concept"
    },
